    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c2-s3-t12 (zh); prose=[]",
        "exercise": "g0/3",
        "text": "3. 两个相干光源$S_1$和$S_2$发出波长为$\\lambda=5\\times10^{-5}$厘米的光。两光源间距为$d=0.3$毫米，屏幕距光源$S_1$为6米。屏幕上的$A$点（图214）会出现什么现象：亮斑还是暗斑？\n约定：按图示的理想几何，观察点是左侧光源向屏幕作垂线的垂足，两光源连线平行于屏幕。假定两光源发出的光同相、偏振方向相同，并在观察点有相等的光强。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c2-s3-t12 (en); prose=[]",
        "exercise": "g0/3",
        "text": "3. Two coherent light sources, $S_1$ and $S_2$, emit light of wavelength $\\lambda=5\\times10^{-5}$ centimeters. Their separation is $d=0.3$ millimeters, and the screen is 6 meters from source $S_1$. What appears at point $A$ on the screen (Figure 214): a bright spot or a dark spot?\nAssumption: in the ideal geometry shown, the observation point is the foot of the perpendicular from the left source to the screen, and the line joining the sources is parallel to the screen. Assume that the sources emit in phase with the same polarization direction and contribute equal intensities at the observation point."
      }
    ],
